{"reviewId": "66920859_84sgSq6GI", "review": {"abstract": "2014年下半年以来，由于受乌克兰局势恶化、对俄罗斯经济制裁升级", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterUid": 14, "content": "对俄罗斯的制裁已经超过十年，如果这次俄乌停战协议达成，制裁会不会全部取消？毕竟，制裁是从克里米亚开始的，这次停战俄罗斯不可能退出克里米亚，连新占领的地方也不会放弃。那么，对俄罗斯的制裁是不是得永远持续？俄罗斯人在开战前想过这个问题吗？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "22400-22432", "createTime": 1762413172, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "66920859_84sgSq6GI", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 363716343, "name": "Seize", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJcobiaGeWYVA5wJorw5n3IGg0OoV5dMSp17aib9h1zS52RDUiasibPKsgNL40MfLa6hhwxF5zErrrN8pSTHSrs1YFicgBgVTOzibYibrmfotJnVDz8A/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}], "commentsCoun